# Qiniu (七牛云)

> Qiniu is a data-centric cloud infrastructure platform for storing, delivering, processing, and
computing over large-scale unstructured data. Its strongest product areas include Object Storage
(Kodo / 对象存储), CDN and full-site acceleration (内容分发网络与全站加速), live video and
audio/video PaaS (直播云 / 音视频 PaaS), intelligent media processing (Dora / 智能媒体处理), and
AI model inference and agent workflows (AI 大模型推理 / AI 智能体). It stands out by combining
these capabilities in one platform for developers and enterprises building storage-heavy,
media-heavy, AI-enabled, and real-time applications.

## Core Capabilities

- [AI Large Model Inference (AI 大模型推理)](https://developer.qiniu.com/aitokenapi):
  OpenAI/Anthropic-compatible model API platform for multimodal inference, OCR, ASR/TTS,
  MCP-related integration, and hosted inference workflows.
- [Full-Stack Application Server (LAS / 全栈应用服务器)](https://developer.qiniu.com/las):
  Managed application-oriented cloud server platform for websites, web apps, mini-program
  backends, dev/test environments, and sandbox-based workloads.
- [Linx AI (灵矽 AI)](https://linx.qiniu.com): AI interaction platform for intelligent hardware, voice
  interaction, low-latency response, and MCP-enabled capability expansion.
- [Object Storage (Kodo / 对象存储)](https://www.qiniu.com/products/kodo): High-availability
  unstructured data storage service for upload/download, lifecycle management, event
  notifications, file operations, and S3-compatible APIs.
- [Cloud Virtual Machine (QVM / 云服务器)](https://www.qiniu.com/products/qvm): Elastic compute
  platform for backend application hosting, cloud instances, disks, images, networks, and
  security groups.
- [Storage Appliance](https://www.qiniu.com/products/storage): Integrated storage appliance for
  enterprise-grade data platforms, combining storage services and intelligent media processing for
  large-scale on-premises and dedicated-cloud data workloads.

